# Dev environment — copy to `.env` at the REPO ROOT (not apps/desktop/).
#
# Loaded by the justfile's `set dotenv-load` and inherited into the Electron
# Main process (`just dev-desktop` → `cd apps/desktop && pnpm run dev`).
# Main reads these at runtime via process.env; Vite does NOT inject them
# (loadEnv only feeds import.meta.env.VITE_*). See ADR-309 §A6.
#
# `.env` is gitignored; this `.env.example` is committed as documentation.
#
# Google OAuth (ADR-309 Part A / O307g) — "Desktop app" OAuth client.
# When GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID is unset, the setup wizard falls back to the mock
# sign-in dialog (platform.auth → not-configured). Prod delivery is O309c.
GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET=
